<title>FRANCE: France Telecom flotation timetable.</title>
<headline>France Telecom flotation timetable.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>France Telecom gave the following timetable for its market flotation.</p>
<p>March 20 Analysts' briefing</p>
<p>    May 5    Announcement of price range in the evening</p>
<p>    May 6    Start of three-week reservation period for</p>
<p>		    retail investors</p>
<p>    May 26   Announcement of price in the evening</p>
<p>    May 27   Start of initial public offering</p>
<p>    June 3   Close of initial public offering</p>
<p>    June 9   First trading in New York and Paris</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
